<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>장소/날씨별 코디 추천</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.css" integrity="sha256-p4NxAoJBhIIN+hmNHrzRCf9tD/miZyoHS5obTRR9BMY=" crossorigin=""/>
  <style>
    :root { --bg:#f6f8fc; --card:#fff; --text:#172033; --muted:#667085; --line:#e4e7ec; --accent:#2563eb; --accent-soft:#eff6ff; --shadow:0 16px 40px rgba(2,8,23,.08); --radius:24px; --good:#10b981; --warn:#f59e0b; --soft-gray:#f8fafc; }
    *{box-sizing:border-box} body{margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,"Noto Sans KR",Arial,sans-serif;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f8fbff 0%,var(--bg) 100%);color:var(--text)}
    .wrap{max-width:1480px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px}.hero{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff 0%,#edf4ff 100%);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:30px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:28px;margin-bottom:20px}
    .hero h1{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:34px;line-height:1.18}.hero p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.8;max-width:980px}
    .layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:420px 1fr;gap:20px;align-items:start}.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:20px}
    .card h2{margin:0 0 14px;font-size:20px}.stack{display:grid;gap:14px}.field{display:grid;gap:8px} label{font-size:14px;font-weight:700}
    input[type="text"],input[type="time"],select{width:100%;padding:13px 14px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;font-size:15px;outline:none;background:#fff} input[type="range"]{width:100%}
    .value{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)} .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}.btn-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:10px}
    button{border:none;border-radius:16px;padding:13px 14px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .15s ease,opacity .15s ease,background-color .15s ease} button:hover{transform:translateY(-1px)}
    .primary{background:var(--accent);color:#fff}.soft{background:var(--accent-soft);color:#1d4ed8}.ghost{background:#f3f4f6;color:#374151}
    #map{width:100%;height:560px;border-radius:22px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--line)}
    .chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}.chip{padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid var(--line);font-size:13px;color:#334155}
    .section-title{font-size:17px;font-weight:800;margin:18px 0 10px}
    .weather-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:12px}.weather-box{padding:14px;border-radius:18px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fbfdff}
    .weather-box .k{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;margin-bottom:6px}.weather-box .v{font-size:22px;font-weight:800}
    .status{padding:12px 14px;border-radius:16px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fafcff;color:#334155;font-size:14px}
    .recommend-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:14px;margin-top:14px}.panel-soft{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;background:#fbfdff;padding:16px}
    .outfit-stack{display:grid;gap:10px}.outfit-item{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;padding:13px 14px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;background:#fff}
    .outfit-item .left{display:grid;gap:6px;min-width:0}.badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#f8fafc;font-size:12px;color:#334155;font-weight:700;width:fit-content}
    .reason-badges{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.reason-badge{padding:5px 9px;border-radius:999px;font-size:11px;border:1px solid #dbe5f1;background:#f8fbff;color:#355070;font-weight:700}
    .name{font-size:16px;font-weight:800}.desc{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;line-height:1.5}.score{min-width:78px;text-align:center;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid var(--line);font-weight:800}
    .rationale{line-height:1.8;color:#334155;font-size:14px}.mini-list{display:grid;gap:10px}.mini-item{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff}
    .mini-item .t{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:4px}.mini-item .v{font-weight:800;font-size:15px}.helper-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:10px}
    .legend{display:grid;gap:8px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}.feedback-wrap{display:grid;gap:10px}.feedback-buttons{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px}
    .feedback-btn{background:#fff;color:#334155;border:1px solid var(--line)}.feedback-btn.active{background:var(--accent-soft);color:#1d4ed8;border-color:#cfe0ff}.feedback-note{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6}
    @media (max-width:1180px){.layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}#map{height:420px}.recommend-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}} @media (max-width:720px){.row,.btn-row,.weather-grid,.helper-grid,.feedback-buttons{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <section class="hero">
      <h1>장소/날씨별 코디 추천</h1>
      <p>지도에서 원하는 위치를 클릭하거나 도시명·좌표로 위치를 선택하면, 해당 시간대의 날씨를 불러와 <strong>clo(의복 보온성) 기반</strong>으로 코디를 추천합니다.<br>단순히 임의 점수를 매기는 대신, <strong>보온 필요량 + 바람/비 대응 + 한국에서 자주 입는 옷 스타일</strong>을 함께 반영합니다.</p>
    </section>
    <div class="layout">
      <section class="card stack">
        <div>
          <h2>위치와 선호 설정</h2>
          <div class="stack">
            <div class="field"><label for="locationInput">도시명 검색</label><input id="locationInput" type="text" placeholder="예: Seoul, Busan, Tokyo, London" /></div>
            <div class="row">
              <div class="field"><label for="postalInput">우편번호 / ZIP 코드</label><input id="postalInput" type="text" placeholder="예: 04524, 100-0001, 10001" /></div>
              <div class="field"><label for="countryInput">국가 코드</label><input id="countryInput" type="text" placeholder="예: KR, JP, US" value="KR" /></div>
            </div>
            <div class="row">
              <div class="field"><label for="latInput">위도</label><input id="latInput" type="text" placeholder="예: 37.5665" /></div>
              <div class="field"><label for="lonInput">경도</label><input id="lonInput" type="text" placeholder="예: 126.9780" /></div>
            </div>
            <div class="btn-row">
              <button class="primary" id="searchBtn">도시 검색</button><button class="soft" id="gpsBtn">내 위치 사용</button><button class="ghost" id="refreshBtn">날씨 새로고침</button>
            </div>
            <div class="btn-row">
              <button class="soft" id="postalBtn">우편번호 검색</button><button class="soft" id="coordBtn">좌표로 이동</button><button class="ghost" id="seoulBtn">서울 예시</button>
            </div>
            <div class="row">
              <div class="field"><label for="startTimeInput">외출 시작 시간</label><input id="startTimeInput" type="time" value="09:00" /></div>
              <div class="field"><label for="endTimeInput">외출 종료 시간</label><input id="endTimeInput" type="time" value="18:00" /></div>
            </div>
            <div class="value">입력한 시간과 가장 가까운 시간대의 날씨를 기준으로 추천합니다. 종료 시간이 시작 시간보다 빠르면 다음 날 종료로 계산합니다.</div>
            <div class="row">
              <div class="field"><label for="moodSelect">코디 방향성</label>
                <select id="moodSelect"><option value="polished">깔끔하게</option><option value="comfy">편하게</option><option value="kkuan">꾸안꾸</option><option value="dressup">드레스업</option></select>
              </div>
              <div class="field"><label for="rangeStrategy">추천 기준</label>
                <select id="rangeStrategy"><option value="balanced">평균 기준</option><option value="cautious">보수적으로</option><option value="light">가볍게</option></select>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="row">
              <div class="field"><label for="envSelect">활동 환경</label>
                <select id="envSelect"><option value="outdoor">주로 실외</option><option value="mixed">실내/실외 혼합</option><option value="indoor">주로 실내</option></select>
              </div>
              <div class="field"><label for="indoorTemp">실내 온도 <span class="value" id="indoorTempVal">24°C</span></label><input id="indoorTemp" type="range" min="16" max="30" step="1" value="24" /></div>
            </div>
            <div class="field"><label for="coldSlider">추위 민감도 <span class="value" id="coldVal">보통</span></label><input id="coldSlider" type="range" min="-2" max="2" step="1" value="0" /></div>
            <div class="field"><label for="rainSlider">비 대비 성향 <span class="value" id="rainVal">보통</span></label><input id="rainSlider" type="range" min="0" max="2" step="1" value="1" /></div>
            <div class="field"><label for="windSlider">바람 민감도 <span class="value" id="windVal">보통</span></label><input id="windSlider" type="range" min="0" max="2" step="1" value="1" /></div>
            <div class="field"><label for="fashionSlider">스타일 중시도 <span class="value" id="fashionVal">보통</span></label><input id="fashionSlider" type="range" min="0" max="2" step="1" value="1" /></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="status" id="statusBox">지도에서 위치를 클릭하거나 도시명을 검색해 주세요.</div>

        <div><div class="section-title">현재 선택 상태</div><div class="chips" id="activeChips"><span class="chip">위치 미선택</span></div></div>

        <div><div class="section-title">추천 로직 요약</div><div class="legend">
          <div>• 보온 기준은 clo 기반으로 계산합니다.</div>
          <div>• 바람은 windproof, 비는 water_resistant 태그를 별도로 반영합니다.</div>
          <div>• 하의도 청바지, 와이드 팬츠, 슬랙스, 조거 팬츠 등으로 더 현실적으로 추천합니다.</div>
          <div>• 피드백 버튼을 누르면 다음 추천에 미세하게 반영됩니다.</div>
        </div></div>
      </section>

      <section class="card">
        <div id="map"></div>

        <div id="weatherPanel" style="margin-top:16px; display:none;">
          <div class="section-title">선택 위치 날씨</div>
          <div class="weather-grid">
            <div class="weather-box"><div class="k">기온</div><div class="v" id="tempBox">-</div></div>
            <div class="weather-box"><div class="k">체감온도</div><div class="v" id="feelBox">-</div></div>
            <div class="weather-box"><div class="k">강수확률</div><div class="v" id="rainBox">-</div></div>
            <div class="weather-box"><div class="k">풍속</div><div class="v" id="windBox">-</div></div>
            <div class="weather-box"><div class="k">날씨</div><div class="v" id="codeBox">-</div></div>
            <div class="weather-box"><div class="k">시간</div><div class="v" id="timeBox" style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.5;">-</div></div>
          </div>

          <div class="recommend-grid">
            <div class="panel-soft"><div class="section-title" style="margin-top:0;">추천 코디</div><div class="outfit-stack" id="outfitList"></div></div>
            <div class="panel-soft"><div class="section-title" style="margin-top:0;">추천 해석</div><div class="mini-list">
              <div class="helper-grid">
                <div class="mini-item"><div class="t">필요 보온량</div><div class="v" id="neededCloBox">-</div></div>
                <div class="mini-item"><div class="t">추천 총 보온량</div><div class="v" id="outfitCloBox">-</div></div>
              </div>
              <div class="helper-grid">
                <div class="mini-item"><div class="t">비 대응 수준</div><div class="v" id="rainNeedBox">-</div></div>
                <div class="mini-item"><div class="t">바람 대응 수준</div><div class="v" id="windNeedBox">-</div></div>
              </div>
              <div class="mini-item"><div class="t">추천 이유</div><div class="rationale" id="explainBox"></div></div>
            </div></div>
          </div>

          <div class="panel-soft" style="margin-top:14px;"><div class="section-title" style="margin-top:0;">오늘의 추천 아이템</div><div class="chips" id="candidateChips"></div></div>

          <div class="panel-soft" style="margin-top:14px;">
            <div class="section-title" style="margin-top:0;">추천 피드백</div>
            <div class="feedback-wrap">
              <div class="feedback-buttons">
                <button class="feedback-btn" id="goodBtn">딱 좋아요</button>
                <button class="feedback-btn" id="coldBtn">조금 추웠어요</button>
                <button class="feedback-btn" id="hotBtn">조금 더웠어요</button>
              </div>
              <div class="feedback-note" id="feedbackNote">피드백을 남기면 다음 추천에서 보온량이 조금씩 보정됩니다.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>

<script src="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.js" integrity="sha256-20nQCchB9co0qIjJZRGuk2/Z9VM+kNiyxNV1lvTlZBo=" crossorigin=""></script>
<script>
